<title>USA: Motorola invests in NetSpeak Corp.</title>
<headline>Motorola invests in NetSpeak Corp.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>NetSpeak Corp said on Tuesday Motorola Inc invested in the company through its New Enterprises program which seeks out companies in emerging industries.</p>
<p>The company did not disclose the amount invested. NetSpeak is an Internet voice telephony company based in Boca Raton, Fla.</p>
